          "No article? Strong endings show gender/case:",
          "",
          "          Masc    Fem     Neut    Plural",
          "NOM:      -er     -e      -es     -e",
          "AKK:      -en     -e      -es     -e",
          "DAT:      -em     -er     -em     -en",
          "GEN:      -en     -er     -en     -er",
          "",
          "EXAMPLES:",
          "begabter Student (gifted student - masc nom)",
          "begabte Studentin (gifted student - fem nom)",
          "begabtes Kind (gifted child - neut nom)",
          "",
          "WITH QUANTITIES:",
          "viele begabte Studenten (many gifted students)",
          "wenige begabte Leute (few gifted people)",
